        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia BTB-9013/415, Urban Back-to-Back Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Back-To-Back Urban Door Pull Pair is part of Omnia's super modern Ultima I collection. This collection is known for its style and contemporary appeal. Choose from satin nickel, polished chrome, and oil-rubbed bronze finishes. The Urban Back-to-Back Pull Set comes packaged as a pair of pulls and back to back mounting hardware. The Omnia Ultima I 9013/415 Door Pull is 17-15/16 inches long.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Packaged with 2 pulls</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima I 9013/415 Door Pull Pair:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 16-5/16\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 17-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia BTB-9013P Pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/urban-door-handle-omnia-9013p-415\"><b>Thru-Bolt Mounted Single Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2) Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
